  "body": "### Describe the bug\n\nDespite user having permission to create apps, use all apps, and modify all apps, the app management page fails to load: \n\n`https://yourserver.com/manage/apps` returns:\n\n> Not Found - Could not find the requested resource\n\nUsers with permission to \"create apps, use all apps, and modify all apps\" should not encounter \"Could not find the requested resource.\" \n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n### User Permissions that Fail\n**Boards**\n\n```\nCreate Boards\nView All Boards\n```\n\n**Apps**\n```\nCreate apps\nUse all apps\nModify all apps\n```\n\n`https://yourserver.com/manage/apps` returns:\n\n> Not Found - Could not find the requested resource\n\n\n\n### Impact\n\n### Workaround\nGrant `Modify all boards` to the user\n\n### Impact\nOver-scopes the intended user permissions\n\n### Additional information\n\n[Homarr Permission Error.pdf](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/31760052/Homarr.Permission.Error.pdf)\n\n### Version\n\n1.76.2\n\n### Installation method\n\nFrom Source\n\n### Browser\n\nChrome",
